/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Our project addresses the main problem of improving human-computer interaction through precise hand gesture recognition. The project's scope includes creating a Hand Gesture Database using near-infrared images captured by the Leap Motion sensor. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
211 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The main challenge that our project tackles is developing a machine learning model capable of accurately recognizing these hand gestures. By leveraging the dataset of near-infrared images, we aim to train a sophisticated recognition system that can interpret gestures and translate them into actionable commands or actions.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
